From 9a905ceef3bd7d78f61dff3c902ac4b38d19215b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Clebert Suconic <clebertsuconic@apache.org>
Date: Thu, 13 Apr 2017 16:53:53 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] ARTEMIS-1114 Missing records after compacting

This is fixing an issue introduced on 4b47461f03a607b9ef517beb2a1666ffae43a2a7 (ARTEMIS-822)
The Transactions were being looked up without the readLock and some of the controls for Read and Write lock
were broken after this.

https://issues.jboss.org/browse/JBEAP-9937

(cherry picked from commit ddacda50626ef2cd5ccf74a3149eccbbda4a9d84)
(cherry picked from commit ec9615a01a847e7a7be95c0d0b45ae0067065504)

